                        Farley and approved by Calhoun on April 28.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d108-f2" n="1" xml:id="d108-f2-content">
                <p>Secretary Dulles resigned for health
                    reasons on April 15. Christian A. Herter
                    became Secretary of State on April 22.</p>
            </note>
